      "zh": "PlayStation Portable 是索尼 2004 年发布的首台掌机，横置宽屏与 UMD 光盘介质，性能接近当时家用机，多媒体能力强，是掌机谱系中索尼的里程碑之作。",
      "en": "The PlayStation Portable, released by Sony in 2004, was Sony's first handheld console, featuring a landscape widescreen and UMD optical discs, with home-console-like performance and strong multimedia capabilities."
